  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Encouraged by the surge in his poll numbers, mayoral candidate Pavel Osipenko immediately phones Governor Viktor Stepanovich. Osipenko expresses extravagant gratitude, praising the governor's cunning political maneuver that discredited Samsonov in front of the electorate.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Алло, Виктор Степанович, здравствуйте!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "viktor",
   "t": "Здравствуй, Павел. Чего тебе?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Это был очень тонкий ход!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Я всё понял, спасибо большое.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "viktor",
   "t": "И это всё, что ты скажешь?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Простите меня, пожалуйста, за глупость.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "viktor",
   "t": "И всё?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Вы гений и выдающийся ум современности!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "viktor",
   "t": "Хватит, не подлизывайся слишком сильно.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "viktor",
   "t": "Ладно, борись дальше за власть.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Я обязательно выиграю эти выборы!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "viktor",
   "t": "Тогда работай усердно и не расслабляйся.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Спасибо за поддержку, Виктор Степанович!",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Let's explore the sycophantic phone exchange between Osipenko and the powerful governor.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Алло, Виктор Степанович, здравствуйте!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Hello, Viktor Stepanovich, good day!' A formal polite greeting over a telephone call.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "viktor",
   "t": "Здравствуй, Павел. Чего тебе?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Hello, Pavel. What do you want?' A brusque question showing the governor's impatient attitude.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Это был очень тонкий ход!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'That was a very subtle move!' Osipenko praises the governor's covert political manipulation.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Я всё понял, спасибо большое.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I understood everything, thank you very much.' Osipenko admits he finally grasps the cunning strategy.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "viktor",
   "t": "И это всё, что ты скажешь?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'And is that all you will say?' The governor playfully pressures him for more groveling apologies.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Простите меня, пожалуйста, за глупость.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Please forgive me for my foolishness.' An apologetic request acknowledging past lack of foresight.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "viktor",
   "t": "И всё?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'And that is all?' A repeated prompt demanding even more flattering subservience.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Вы гений и выдающийся ум современности!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You are a genius and the greatest mind of our time!' High praise describing peerless intellectual brilliance.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "viktor",
   "t": "Хватит, не подлизывайся слишком сильно.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Enough, do not flatter too much.' An imperative warning against excessively shameless flattery.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "viktor",
   "t": "Ладно, борись дальше за власть.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Alright, keep fighting for power.' The governor gives his curt blessing to continue the race.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Я обязательно выиграю эти выборы!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I will definitely win these elections!' Osipenko boldly predicts his eventual electoral victory.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "viktor",
   "t": "Тогда работай усердно и не расслабляйся.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Then work hard and do not relax.' Pragmatic advice telling the candidate to stay vigilant.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
